<title>USA: FGIC qualifies two issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies two issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. said it has qualified for bond insurance the following two municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Bridgewater, Mass., $5 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Holland, Mich., $11 million water supply system revenue bonds.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
</text>
